## Data Flow Examples

### Example 1: User Buys Options

```
1. User → OptionExchange.operate()
   ├─ Input: Series, amount, acceptablePremium
   └─ Validates: Series in OptionCatalogue

2. OptionExchange → BeyondPricer.quoteOptionPrice()
   ├─ Gets: Spot price from PriceFeed
   ├─ Gets: IV from VolatilityFeed
   ├─ Calculates: Premium, delta, fees
   └─ Returns: Quote

3. OptionExchange → LiquidityPool.handlerWriteOption()
   ├─ Checks: Available collateral
   ├─ Allocates: Collateral for option
   ├─ Updates: ephemeralDelta, ephemeralLiabilities
   └─ Calls: OptionRegistry.issue()

4. OptionRegistry → Opyn Controller
   ├─ Creates: Vault (if needed)
   ├─ Deposits: Collateral
   ├─ Mints: oTokens
   └─ Transfers: oTokens to user

5. User receives: oToken ERC20 tokens
```

### Example 2: Vault Deposit & Withdrawal

```
1. User → LiquidityPool.deposit(1000 USDC)
   ├─ Transfers: USDC to pool
   ├─ Creates: DepositReceipt { epoch: N, amount: 1000 }
   └─ Updates: pendingDeposits += 1000

2. Keeper → LiquidityPool.executeEpochCalculation()
   ├─ Calls: AlphaPortfolioValuesFeed.getPortfolioValues()
   │   └─ Calculates: NAV from all positions
   ├─ Calculates: depositPPS = NAV / totalShares
   ├─ Sets: depositEpochPricePerShare[N] = PPS
   └─ Increments: depositEpoch++

3. User → LiquidityPool.completeDeposit()
   ├─ Calculates: shares = amount / PPS
   ├─ Mints: ERC20 shares to user
   └─ Clears: DepositReceipt

Withdrawal (similar flow):
4. User → initiateWithdraw(shares)
   ├─ Burns: Shares immediately
   └─ Creates: WithdrawalReceipt

5. Keeper → executeEpochCalculation()
   └─ Sets aside: partitionedFunds

6. User → completeWithdraw()
   └─ Receives: USDC from partitionedFunds
```

### Example 3: Delta Hedging

```
1. Options Activity creates delta exposure
   └─ LiquidityPool.ephemeralDelta = +10 ETH (too long)

2. Keeper detects imbalance
   └─ Calls: LiquidityPool.rebalancePortfolioDelta(-10 ETH, reactorIndex)

3. LiquidityPool → HedgingReactor.hedgeDelta(-10 ETH)
   
4. HedgingReactor executes hedge:
   
   Option A - UniswapV3HedgingReactor:
   └─ Sells 10 ETH on Uniswap V3
   
   Option B - PerpHedgingReactor:
   ├─ Requests collateral from pool
   └─ Opens short perp position (10 ETH) on Rage Trade
   
   Option C - GmxHedgingReactor:
   └─ Creates short position (10 ETH) on GMX

5. Reactor → returns new delta
   └─ LiquidityPool.ephemeralDelta updated to ~0
```

