## Access Control

### Role Hierarchy

```
GOVERNANCE_ROLE (Multi-sig)
  └─→ Can grant/revoke all roles
      └─→ Emergency contract upgrades

MANAGER_ROLE (Operations team)
  └─→ Set risk parameters
  └─→ Approve hedging reactors
  └─→ Manage option catalogue
  └─→ Pause/unpause trading

KEEPER_ROLE (Automated bots)
  └─→ Execute epochs
  └─→ Rebalance delta
  └─→ Update volatility feeds
  └─→ Settle expired options

HANDLER (Approved contracts)
  └─→ OptionExchange
  └─→ AlphaOptionHandler
  └─→ Can write/buy options on behalf of pool
```

### Critical Functions Access Control

```solidity
// GOVERNANCE only
function grantRole(bytes32 role, address account)
function revokeRole(bytes32 role, address account)

// MANAGER only
function setBufferPercentage(uint256 _bufferPercentage)
function addHedgingReactor(address reactor)
function pause() / unpause()
function setCollateralCap(uint256 _cap)

// KEEPER only
function executeEpochCalculation()
function rebalancePortfolioDelta(int256 delta, uint256 reactorIndex)

// HANDLER only
function handlerWriteOption(...)
function handlerBuybackOption(...)
```

