### Key Calculations

```solidity
// Price Per Share
PPS = NAV / totalShares

// NAV
NAV = collateralBalance + collateralInUse + hedgingValue - liabilities

// Available Collateral
available = (balance * (1 - bufferPct)) - allocated

// Option Delta
delta = BlackScholes.calculateDelta(...)

// Slippage
slippage = baseSlippage * deltaBandMultiplier * poolExposure
```

